OL,3,GNEWSANew weather warnings as third
OL,4,Astorm set to hit Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo new weather warnings have been
OL,7,Fissued as a third storm in a matter of
OL,8,Fdays is set to batter Scotland.
OL,10,FIt comes as thousands of homes across
OL,11,Fthe country remain without power in the
OL,12,Faftermath of Storm Boelo.
OL,14,FA yellow warning for wind covering the
OL,15,Fsouth-west of Scotland came into effect
OL,16,Fat 18:00 and runs until 03:00 on
OL,17,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
